<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="text-size-adjust: 100%; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-bottom: 1em;"><font color="#333333" face="Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" size="4">{!Lead.FirstName},</font></p><div style="font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div id="bloop_customfont" style=""><div style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px;"><p style="text-size-adjust: 100%; margin-bottom: 1em;"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-family: helvetica;">Now that you have determined that we are the right investment company to help you achieve your real estate goals, it is time to take the next steps to put you into the position to make your first property selection with us.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-size-adjust: 100%; margin-bottom: 1em;"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-family: helvetica;">We have already discussed the average price points and ROI for our typical properties, so now, lets review a few specific properties that we have recently completed.</span></p><p style="text-size-adjust: 100%; margin-bottom: 1em;"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-family: helvetica;">These properties are&nbsp;<strong>NOT</strong>&nbsp;available as they are example properties that were acquired by other clients recently. The purpose of sending you these&nbsp;properties&nbsp;is to help you familiarize yourself with our process and what to look for when we send you property evaluations.</span></p><p style="text-size-adjust: 100%; margin-bottom: 1em;"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-family: helvetica;">First, you will find example&nbsp;<strong>scopes of work</strong>&nbsp;for several properties, which will enable you to get a feel for what your property will look like before and after the rehab is completed.</span></p><p style="text-size-adjust: 100%; margin-bottom: 1em;"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-family: helvetica;">Remember, when we show you a new property, it is still under rehab so we will most likely not have the after pictures available to show you. So, it is very important that you have an idea as to what the finished product will look like.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-size-adjust: 100%; margin-bottom: 1em;"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-family: helvetica;">Next, I have attached a sample&nbsp;<strong>property evaluation</strong>, which will show you how we calculate our return numbers. When a property becomes available that matches the investment criteria we have developed for you, I will send over the property in this exact format.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-size-adjust: 100%; margin-bottom: 1em;"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-family: helvetica;">Lastly, I am attaching several&nbsp;<strong>lenders and their contact information</strong>&nbsp;for you as we discussed. Before I can show you any specific available properties, you&nbsp;<strong>must</strong>&nbsp;have financing secured. So, as soon as the lender gives you approval, please let me know.</span></p></div><p style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; text-size-adjust: 100%; margin-bottom: 1em;"><span style="font-family: helvetica; font-size: 18px;">After you have had a chance to review this information, please&nbsp;</span><strong style="font-family: helvetica; font-size: 18px;"><span style="color: rgb(53, 116, 227);"><a href="https://my.timetrade.com/book/HFY5P" data-hs-link-id="0" target="_blank" style="text-size-adjust: 100%; border-bottom: none; color: rgb(53, 116, 227);">Click Here</a></span></strong><span style="font-family: helvetica; font-size: 18px;">&nbsp;to set up your next call with me so we can continue to move you along in the process&nbsp;towards building your passive real estate portfolio.&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</p><p style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; text-size-adjust: 100%; margin-bottom: 1em;"><br></p><p style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; text-size-adjust: 100%; margin-bottom: 1em;"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><span face="HelveticaNeue" style="font-family: HelveticaNeue;">Talk soon,</span></span></p><p style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; text-size-adjust: 100%; margin-bottom: 1em;"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><span face="HelveticaNeue" style="font-family: HelveticaNeue;">Joshua</span></span></p><p style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; text-size-adjust: 100%; margin-bottom: 1em;"><a href="https://my.timetrade.com/book/HFY5P "><br></a></p><div style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px;"><a href="https://my.timetrade.com/book/HFY5P "><br></a></div><div style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px;"><span style="text-size-adjust: 100%; border-bottom-width: initial; border-bottom-color: initial;"><a href="https://my.timetrade.com/book/HFY5P "><img src="https://cdn2.hubspot.net/hub/44341/hubfs/Email%20signature%20-%20final%20-%20without%20banner.png?t=1509636987367&amp;width=600&amp;name=Email%20signature%20-%20final%20-%20without%20banner.png" alt="Email signature - final - without banner.png" width="600" title="Email signature - final - without banner.png" caption="false" data-constrained="true" style="vertical-align: bottom; width: 600px;"></a></span></div><div style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px;"><a href="https://my.timetrade.com/book/HFY5P ">&nbsp;</a></div><div style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px;"><span style="text-size-adjust: 100%; border-bottom-width: initial; border-bottom-color: initial;"><a href="https://my.timetrade.com/book/HFY5P "><img src="https://cdn2.hubspot.net/hub/44341/hubfs/Email%20signature%20-%20final%20-%20banner%20only.png?t=1509636987367&amp;width=600&amp;name=Email%20signature%20-%20final%20-%20banner%20only.png" alt="Email signature - final - banner only.png" width="600" title="Email signature - final - banner only.png" caption="false" data-constrained="true" style="vertical-align: bottom; width: 600px;"></a></span></div><p style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; text-size-adjust: 100%; margin-bottom: 1em;"><br></p><p style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-size-adjust: 100%; margin-bottom: 1em;"><br></p></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div class="gmail_signature" data-smartmail="gmail_signature"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div><font size="1" style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif;"><br></font></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div>]]></td>
